    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is i don't think a single big transfer is safe. if i move everything at once, i'm certain they'll see it coming and just freeze the account before the money clears. they've been watching me too closely for that to work. is there a way to bleed the account out slowly or use different methods so they don't realize i'm actually trying to escape their liquidation process?",
